return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:59+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:59+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — footprint-free PBN, WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Ka iibi Zinn Digital® martigelinta mareegaha adiga tixraacaya boggaaga WordPress — martigelinta PBN ee aan lahayn raadka cagta, WordPress, WooCommerce, wakiil, dib-u-iibiye, daruur iyo VPS. Raadi oo bixi domain-yada akoonkaaga dib-u-iibiyaha, macaamiishaada si toos ah uga gali guddigooda martigelinta, oo si toos ah u habee martigelinta marka dalbashada WooCommerce la bixiyo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Madasha martigelinta waxay ku jawaabtay heerka %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Raadi magacaaga domain-ka','Search'=>'Raadi','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Magacaas lama hubin wax kordhin ah.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Raadinta domain-ka lagama heli karo boggan hadda.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Waqtigan xaadirka ah ma aanu gaari karin diiwaanka domain-ka. Fadlan isku day mar kale cabbaar yar kadib.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Settings → Zinn® Reseller.'=>'Furaha API waa maqan yahay ama ma shaqeynayo hadda. Ka hubi hoostooda Settings → Zinn® Reseller.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Furaha API-gan ma wado ogolaanshaha sites.view, ee ay raadinta domain-ku u baahan tahay. Ku dar furahaaga gudihiisa qaybtaada iibiyaha (reseller panel), ama halkaan ka tirtir furaha si aad ugu noqoto raadinta dadweynaha.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Maamulayaashu kaliya ayaa arka tan:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Midan ma hubin karno — mar kale isku day','Already registered'=>'Horay ayaa loo diiwaangeliyay','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Waa la heli karaa — naga codso qiime','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Waa la heli karaa — %1$s %2$s sanadka ugu horreeya','Register it'=>'Isku diiwaangeli','Manage my hosting'=>'Maaree martigelinta aan leeyahay','Please sign in first.'=>'Fadlan marka hore soo gal.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Akongigani wali lama xiriirin adeeg hosting ah.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Madal ah agabka martigelinta ma aysan soo celin xiriiriyaha saxiixa.','Zinn® Reseller'=>'Zinn® Reseller','Settings'=>'Dejinta','Connect this site to your Zinn® reseller account, then switch on only the parts you need.'=>'Goobtan ku xidh koontadaada iibiyaha ee Zinn®, kadibna shid qaybaha aad u baahan tahay oo keliya.','API key'=>'Furaha API','Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under API keys. Give it only the permissions the modules below need.'=>'Ka samee mid ka mid ah guddigaaga maamulka ee Zinn® ee hoos yimaada furayaasha API-ga. Sii kaliya fasaxyada ay u baahan yihiin qaybaha hoose.','API address'=>'Cinwaanka API','Panel address'=>'Ciwaanka guddiga','Where your clients are sent to manage their hosting. If you have set a panel hostname under Reselling → Your brand, put it here — your clients then never see our address at all.'=>'Meesha macaamiishaada loo diro si ay u maamulaan martigelintooda. Haddii aad dejisay magaca martigeliyaha ee guddiga hoos yimaada Iibinta Dib-u-iibinta → Summadaada, halkan geli — macaamiishaadu markaas marnagaba ma arki doonaan ciwaankayaga.','Modules'=>'Qaybaha','Domain search — the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode, priced from your own domain account.'=>'Baaritaanka domain-ka — gaabiyaha [zinn_domain_search], oo laga qiimeeyay akoonkaaga domain-ka.','Panel link — the [zinn_panel_link] shortcode signs a logged-in client into their hosting.'=>'Xiriiriyaha guddiga — gaabiyaha [zinn_panel_link] wuxuu macaamiisha soo galay ka saxiixaa martigelintooda.','WooCommerce — provision hosting automatically when an order is paid.'=>'WooCommerce — si otomaatig ah u bixi martigelinta marka la bixiyo dalabka.','WooCommerce is not active on this site, so this module is doing nothing.'=>'WooCommerce kuma shaqeynayo boggan, markaa module-kan wax shaqo ah ma qabanayo.','Default plan code'=>'Koodka qorshaha caadiga ah','Used for a WooCommerce product that does not name its own plan. Set the per-product plan on the product itself under Inventory.'=>'Waxaa loo adeegsadaa badeecada WooCommerce ee aan magacaabin qorshaheeda u gaarka ah. Qorshaha badeecada kasta ku deji badeecada dhexdeeda hoosta Inventory.','Connection'=>'Isku-xirka','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Weli furaha API ma jiro, markaa waxba kuma xirna.','Not connected: %s'=>'Lama xiriirin: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'Ku xiran. Barnaamijkaaga dib-u-iibiyaha waa %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Ma jiro fure Zinn® API ah oo loo habeeyey, markaa waxba lama bixin.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Dalabkani kuma uusan jirin magac domain ah, markaa ma jirin wax la bixiyo.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Goobaha martigelintu ma aysan soo celin degel.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'Adeegga martigelinta ee Zinn® ee loo qoondeeyey %1$s (adeegga %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Madasha martigelinta ma aysan soo celin koontada macaamiisha.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Zinn® hosting ma aanaysan: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Khadka badeecada ee Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Safafka badeecada ee Zinn® ee la bixinayo marka badeecadan la iibsado. Iskada banaan si aad u isticmaasho midka caadiga ah ee ka yimid dejinta qalabka dheeriga ah.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Zinn® hosting','Service id'=>'Aqoonsiga adeegga','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Waxba looma qoondeeyanin dalabkan.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhriso hagaha isticmaalaha ee %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Haye\'ynta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, gurmadyada maalinlaha ah, haajiridda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga maamulka ee loo dhisay dadka maamula in ka badan hal degel.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibsii oo iibi mareegaha, domaynada iyo meelaha xiriirinta ee la dhisay, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo haynayo ilaa inta labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan shaqadan u leh xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa caalamiga ah ee qandaraaslayaasha: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaarsan oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u oggolow inay ku tartamaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey ayaa ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka hufnaanta waxaana la rakibay.']];